/apps/1207320/extras/86f40c27d688fdd843b91a48533740e3.webm?t=1675443947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207320/extras/86f40c27d688fdd843b91a48533740e3.mp4?t=1675443947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207320/extras/e33de0c2615f5808eb41a62037e0eea0.avif?t=1675443947\" /></div><br>Get a clear view on which new features we're currently working on and see a list of upcoming features in one place. Check out our roadmap available on Trello.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207320/extras/500e04063618dab23a37f7d04895c6aa.avif?t=1675443947\" /></div><br>Become a part of our community and join us on our Discord server.<br>",
    "short_description": "Gray Zone is best described as Men of War meets Commandos in a futuristic coat. It's an odyssey of a slave who turned against his masters. Use stealth or direct combat in a squad-based encounters. Expect memorable characters, fun dialogues and lots of action!",
